{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MatomoEncoding"}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"outcome","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"of","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HTTPTransportResponse","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations21HTTPTransportResponseV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EncodedRequest","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations14EncodedRequestV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResponseOutcome","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations15ResponseOutcomeO"}],"externalID":"s:14MatomoEncoding0A12BatchEncoderV7outcome2of3for16HTTPDestinations15ResponseOutcomeOAG013HTTPTransportI0V_AG14EncodedRequestVtFZ","roleHeading":"Type Method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"MatomoBatchEncoder.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder.swift#L131"},"role":"symbol","title":"outcome(of:for:)"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/outcome(of:for:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding","doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"What Matomo’s 2xx answer to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"request"},{"text":" means: transient when Matomo counted fewer of its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracking requests than were sent, rejected when it refused every one it counted, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivered otherwise.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"outcome"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"response"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPTransportResponse","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"HTTPTransportResponse","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations21HTTPTransportResponseV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"request"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/EncodedRequest","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EncodedRequest","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations14EncodedRequestV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/ResponseOutcome","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ResponseOutcome","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations15ResponseOutcomeO"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"response","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The 2xx answer.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"request","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The request it answers, a tracking request for each of its records.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Whether Matomo stored the request’s tracking requests, as far as its answer says.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Matomo answers a bulk request it reads with 200 and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"{\"status\": \"success\", \"tracked\": n, \"invalid\": m}"},{"type":"text","text":". When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tracked"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid"},{"type":"text","text":" add up to fewer than the request’s tracking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requests, or are both 0, Matomo skipped some without saying so, as it does after a database"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lock wait timeout, and the answer is "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/ResponseOutcome\/transient(reason:)"},{"type":"text","text":":"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" sends the request again until its deadline, 23 hours after its oldest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record, and Matomo, which removes no duplicates, counts the ones it tracked again. When it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked none and refused some, as for a site ID of no site, the answer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/ResponseOutcome\/rejected(reason:)"},{"type":"text","text":", so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" drops the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request and reports it. When it tracked some and refused others, the answer says how many"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but not which, so the request is delivered, with a notice logged. A body that isn’t such an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"answer, an empty one or one with a negative count included, is delivered. That includes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the image a server with the QueuedTracking plugin’s queue on sends for every bulk request,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before it checks any tracking request: such a server stores the valid ones later and drops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the others, a site ID of no site included, without a report. The encoder logs a notice the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first time its destination gets an answer that isn’t a bulk answer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/didReceive(_:for:)"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/matomoencoding\/matomobatchencoder\/outcome(of:for:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations/BatchEncoder":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What turns a batch of records into the requests "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" sends."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/batchencoder","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","kind":"symbol","title":"BatchEncoder","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://MatomoEncoding/documentation/MatomoEncoding/MatomoBatchEncoder/didReceive(_:for:)":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/didReceive(_:for:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Logs a notice the first time Matomo gives this encoder’s destination a 2xx answer that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"isn’t a bulk answer with tracking counts, as a server with the QueuedTracking plugin’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queue on answers every bulk request."}],"url":"\/documentation\/matomoencoding\/matomobatchencoder\/didreceive(_:for:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"didReceive"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations21HTTPTransportResponseV","text":"HTTPTransportResponse"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations14EncodedRequestV","text":"EncodedRequest"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"title":"didReceive(_:for:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://MatomoEncoding/documentation/MatomoEncoding/MatomoBatchEncoder":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MatomoBatchEncoder"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" of Matomo’s bulk tracking API, so an ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"send events to a Matomo installation’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"POST \/matomo.php","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/matomoencoding\/matomobatchencoder","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MatomoBatchEncoder"}],"title":"MatomoBatchEncoder","kind":"symbol"},"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations/BatchEncoder/outcome(of:for:)":{"required":true,"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What the successful (2xx) answer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"response"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"request"},{"type":"text